From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:19:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0899/3799] soh: rename D_80B0B49C -> sFocusOffset

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: Vec3f { 700, 400, 0 } fed to Matrix_MultVec3f to place actor.focus.pos during limb drawing.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sth/z_en_sth.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sth/z_en_sth.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sth/z_en_sth.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sth/z_en_sth.c
index 6978a2781..ef5f02610 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sth/z_en_sth.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sth/z_en_sth.c
@@ -99,7 +99,8 @@ static s16 sGetItemIds[6] = {
     GI_RUPEE_GOLD, GI_WALLET_ADULT, GI_STONE_OF_AGONY, GI_WALLET_GIANT, GI_BOMBCHUS_10, GI_HEART_PIECE,
 };
 
-static Vec3f D_80B0B49C = { 700.0f, 400.0f, 0.0f };
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80B0B49C: Vec3f { 700, 400, 0 } fed to Matrix_MultVec3f to place actor.focus.pos during limb drawing.
+static Vec3f sFocusOffset = { 700.0f, 400.0f, 0.0f };  // was D_80B0B49C [LLM:HIGH]
 
 static Color_RGB8 sTunicColors[6] = {
     { 190, 110, 0 }, { 0, 180, 110 }, { 0, 255, 80 }, { 255, 160, 60 }, { 190, 230, 250 }, { 240, 230, 120 },
@@ -385,7 +386,7 @@ void EnSth_PostLimbDraw(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3s* rot,
     EnSth* this = (EnSth*)thisx;
 
     if (limbIndex == 15) {
-        Matrix_MultVec3f(&D_80B0B49C, &this->actor.focus.pos);
+        Matrix_MultVec3f(&sFocusOffset, &this->actor.focus.pos);  // was D_80B0B49C [LLM:HIGH]
         if (this->actor.params != 0) { // Children
             OPEN_DISPS(play->state.gfxCtx);
 
